---
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
permalink: /blog/
description: "Writing by Simon Stafferton on technical SEO, analytics and conversion."
---
<div class="wrap">
  <h1 class="page-title">Writing</h1>
  <p class="lede" style="margin-block-start:1.25rem">
    Notes on search, measurement and the occasional thing that annoyed me enough
    to write about.
  </p>

  <ul class="entries" style="margin-block-start:3rem">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <li class="entry">
        <span class="entry__date">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | displayDate }}</time>
        </span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="entry__title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          {% if post.data.excerpt %}<p class="entry__excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
